// Pine conformance fixture — math.abs.
// Hand-authored per PRD §2.1 (clean-room): no TradingView / community
// source consulted while writing this pair.
//
// Shape: absolute value of a de-meaned close series (close - open) is a
// signed number; ``math.abs`` flips negatives to positives while leaving
// zeros / positives untouched. The reference CSV lists the expected
// per-bar output.
//@version=6
indicator("math_abs", overlay=false)
plot(math.abs(close - open), title="abs_val")
